Missed a word &quot;have&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Ensembles&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Ensembles&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When the ledger is created, E bookies are chosen for the entries of that ledger. The bookies are the initial ensemble of the ledger. A ledger can &lt;ins&gt;have&lt;/ins&gt; multiple ensembles, but an entry has only one ensemble. Changes in the ensemble, involves a new fragment being added to the ledger.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
